# Master / reference footage.
#
# These are the sources design works from, not what the site serves: the
# browser is given the optimised derivatives in
# legacy_web/public/media/ instead. Keeping the masters out of the
# repository is why a hero film costs 4 MB of history rather than 250 MB.
DOCUMENTS/*.mov
DOCUMENTS/*.MOV
DOCUMENTS/*.mp4

.DS_Store

# The client's supplied source material — briefs, approved HTML, the assets
# that come with them. Removed from the repository in October 2026 and kept
# out since: the files that the site actually serves are copied into
# legacy_web/public and recorded in ASSET-LICENSES.md, and a brief folder is
# several megabytes of material the build never reads.
/DOCUMENTS/
